# Rust build output
**/target/

# Downloaded fixed Hermes source is kept in the local staging area; provenance is recorded in docs/reference.
.staging/

# Local dependency and environment material
**/node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Interrupted atomic-write scratch files are never source artifacts
**/*.tmp.*
**/__pycache__/
.doofus/.mutation.lock/
.doofus/.mutation.lock.recovered-*/
